"""kflux - Fluxbox-style configuration for a labwc + KDE desktop.

The user edits Fluxbox-format files in ~/.config/kflux:

    init        session.* resources (toolbar, slit, workspaces, focus, style)
    keys        Fluxbox keys file (keyboard and mouse bindings)
    apps        Fluxbox apps file (per-window rules, [startup] entries)
    menu        Fluxbox root menu
    windowmenu  Fluxbox window menu
    slitlist    kflux "dockapps" shown in the slit, one per line
    startup     shell lines run when the session starts

and any Fluxbox style (file or directory with theme.cfg). `kflux apply`
renders them into labwc (rc.xml, menu.xml, autostart, theme + SVG buttons),
Waybar (toolbar + slit), mako, swaylock, a wallpaper and a KDE colour scheme,
then reloads the running session.
"""
